1
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:10,030
I have the honor to present David Zasloff for Boston University's honorary degree.

2
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:24,140
I now call upon Dr. David Zasloff to deliver the 150th commencement address of Boston University.

3
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:31,760
Wow. I couldn't be more excited to be here with all of you.

4
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:38,660
If you want to be successful, you're going to have to figure out how to get along with everyone.

5
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:57,700
And that includes difficult people. People will be looking for a fight.

